msgstr "Adaptive Gripper Controller"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:9
#: 99a12c4b92d242c48c37c9ede67e0f8f
msgid ""
"Adaptive Gripper Controller (`adaptive_gripper_controller`) drives 夹爪 "
"such as RG75. Dexterous hands (灵巧手, LinkerHand) use [Basic Joint "
"Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md). Listed in the "
"[arms_ros2_control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.md). The launch stack does **not**"
" take `gripper:=`. Attach an end-effector with `type` / `left_type` / "
"`right_type` (and optional `robot_profile` / `use_profile_eef`) from "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Adaptive Gripper Controller`（`adaptive_gripper_controller`）驱动夹爪（如 "
"RG75）。灵巧手（LinkerHand）走 [`Basic Joint "
"Controller`](7-basic_joint_controller.md)。见 [arms_ros2_control "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.md)。launch 栈**没有** `gripper:=`。用 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md) 的 `type` / `left_type`"
" / `right_type`（以及可选的 `robot_profile` / `use_profile_eef`）挂载末端。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:11
#: f39fd0fb56d64ce18989bbbe9e0ff9e2
msgid ""
"Pin: [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/adaptive_gripper_controller/README.md)."
" How to refresh the pin (and recompute `:start-line:` / `:end-line:`): "
"[Documentation Build](../../5-developer/2-docs_build.md#vendored-"
"upstream-readme)."
msgstr ""
"钉选：[`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/controller/adaptive_gripper_controller/README.md)。如何刷新钉选（并重算"
" `:start-line:` / `:end-line:`）：[文档构建](../../5-developer/2-docs_build.md"
"#vendored-upstream-readme)。"

